$ go build misuse.go
$ ./misuse careless
loop: got 1
panic: runtime error: range function continued iteration after function for loop body returned false
exit status 2
$ ./misuse swallows
panic: runtime error: range function recovered a loop body panic and did not resume panicking
exit status 2
$ ./misuse stashes
loop: got 1
main: the loop is over
panic: runtime error: range function continued iteration after whole loop exit
exit status 2
